# Files that run on a Linux / macOS host after the hub sends them. A Windows checkout (core.autocrlf=true is Git for Windows' default)
# would turn them into CRLF, and `#!/bin/bash\r` does not start. The agent bundle, the harness and the service templates are packed
# from the checkout, so they are LF on every OS.
*.sh text eol=lf
install.sh text eol=lf
harness/** text eol=lf
deploy/** text eol=lf
